   "The booklet pages are small illustrations, so exact stud positions and some rests_on relations are inferred from the pictures and the parts list.",
   "Piece order follows the 10 steps: wings (1-3), light-grey clip plates under the wing (4), nose wheel holder and black fuselage plate (5), black side plates and yellow tail wedges (6), black jumpers and sloped tail (7), cockpit jumpers (8), white plates and slopes (9), propeller, windows, red tail light and yellow wing slopes (10).",
   "Yellow cheese slopes b33/b34 are placed on the wing plates; they are listed last for convenience.",
   "The propeller b29 clutches nothing below it, so rests_on is empty; it is attached by an axle join to b11.",
   "Total is 34 pieces, matching the parts list."
